<title>CANADA: Glamis Gold delays dividend decision.</title>
<headline>Glamis Gold delays dividend decision.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glamis Gold Ltd said on Tuesday that dividends normally paid in Spetember will not be paid this year.</p>
<p>Since the company has changed its fiscal year end to December 31 from June 30, a decision on a dividend payment will be delayed until results for the year ending December 31, 1996, are reviewed, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
